# What Vercel does not need.
#
# The site is built locally (python tools/build_site.py) and the finished HTML is committed,
# so the sources and the build tooling never have to be uploaded. Nothing here is served.
#
# The originals matter most: assets/video/_originals holds a 14 MB source file that no page
# references, and it was going up with every deploy.

src/
tools/
data/
docs/
integrations/
legacy/

assets/video/_originals/
assets/img/_source/

*.py
add-items-script.js
fix-delete-script.js
skills-lock.json
patient-portal/
patients_portal_for_hosting.html
